[11:35:09.311] CORE EXPERIMENT - C objects -> virtual addresses (README 九)
[11:35:09.311] ======================================================================
[11:35:09.311] PIE + ASLR randomize ABSOLUTE addresses, but the relative layout
[11:35:09.311] (text/rodata/data/bss < heap < mmap < stack) is preserved.
